{"verse_key": "10:12", "surah": 10, "verse": 12, "text_uthmani": "وَإِذَا مَسَّ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ ٱلضُّرُّ دَعَانَا لِجَنۢبِهِۦٓ أَوْ قَاعِدًا أَوْ قَآئِمًا فَلَمَّا كَشَفْنَا عَنْهُ ضُرَّهُۥ مَرَّ كَأَن لَّمْ يَدْعُنَآ إِلَىٰ ضُرٍّ مَّسَّهُۥ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ زُيِّنَ لِلْمُسْرِفِينَ مَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ", "translation": "And when affliction touches man, he calls upon Us, whether lying on his side or sitting or standing; but when We remove from him his affliction, he continues [in disobedience] as if he had never called upon Us to [remove] an affliction that touched him. Thus is made pleasing to the transgressors that which they have been doing.", "verse_from_ms": 238890, "verse_to_ms": 278600, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَإِذَا", "start_ms": 238890, "end_ms": 240030}, {"i": 1, "text": "مَسَّ", "start_ms": 240030, "end_ms": 240580}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ", "start_ms": 240580, "end_ms": 242210}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱلضُّرُّ", "start_ms": 242210, "end_ms": 243090}, {"i": 4, "text": "دَعَانَا", "start_ms": 243090, "end_ms": 244020}, {"i": 5, "text": "لِجَنۢبِهِۦٓ", "start_ms": 244020, "end_ms": 246910}, {"i": 6, "text": "أَوْ", "start_ms": 246910, "end_ms": 247350}, {"i": 7, "text": "قَاعِدًا", "start_ms": 247350, "end_ms": 248500}, {"i": 8, "text": "أَوْ", "start_ms": 248500, "end_ms": 248750}, {"i": 9, "text": "قَآئِمًا", "start_ms": 248750, "end_ms": 252119}, {"i": 10, "text": "فَلَمَّا", "start_ms": 252120, "end_ms": 253570}, {"i": 11, "text": "كَشَفْنَا", "start_ms": 253570, "end_ms": 254520}, {"i": 12, "text": "عَنْهُ", "start_ms": 254520, "end_ms": 255100}, {"i": 13, "text": "ضُرَّهُۥ", "start_ms": 255100, "end_ms": 256110}, {"i": 14, "text": "مَرَّ", "start_ms": 256110, "end_ms": 256730}, {"i": 15, "text": "كَأَن", "start_ms": 256730, "end_ms": 257260}, {"i": 16, "text": "لَّمْ", "start_ms": 257260, "end_ms": 257650}, {"i": 17, "text": "يَدْعُنَآ", "start_ms": 257650, "en